WEBVTT

00:10:28.866 --> 00:10:31.882
(In Yoruba) “Ènìyàn kan lon bímọ,
gbogbo ayé lon tọ́ ọmọ.”

00:10:32.903 --> 00:10:35.182
All of our children deserve
protection and help.

00:10:35.730 --> 00:10:38.296
And staying silent does not
make things better.

00:10:38.320 --> 00:10:41.272
So let's make our community
and world a better place

00:10:41.296 --> 00:10:43.536
by making standing up to
discrimination and hate

00:10:43.560 --> 00:10:44.857
everyone's business.